    'cd.cal.nota': '<b>Outlook</b>: they open ready, press «Save». <b>Google Calendar</b>: a tab opens for each date, press «Save». Rows without a date do not go into the calendar.', 'cd.cal.ok': '{n} dates sent to the calendar',
    'cg.h': 'Share and connect', 'cg.s': 'Email, Word, Google Docs and calendar work right away, from the «Share» button of each recording. These are connected once:',
    'cg.slack.s': 'the summary in a channel', 'cg.teams.s': 'the summary in a channel', 'cg.notion.s': 'one page per meeting or lecture', 'cg.crm.s': 'the minutes in the customer record', 'cg.crm.n': 'CRM (HubSpot, or Zapier/Make for the others)',
    'cg.collega': 'Connect…', 'cg.togli': 'Disconnect', 'cg.ok': '✓ connected', 'cg.auto': 'by itself after each meeting', 'cg.auto.ck': 'Send the summary by itself after each meeting (not lectures)', 'cg.prova': 'Connect and test', 'cg.fatto': 'Connected: {n}',
    'cg.slack.t': 'Connect Slack', 'cg.slack.p': '1. Open <b>api.slack.com/apps</b> → <b>Create New App</b> → «From scratch», name «Verba Manent IA», your workspace<br>2. On the left <b>Incoming Webhooks</b> → turn on → <b>Add New Webhook</b> → choose the channel<br>3. Copy the address starting with <b>https://hooks.slack.com/…</b> and paste it here',
    'cg.teams.t': 'Connect Microsoft Teams', 'cg.teams.p': '1. In Teams open the channel → <b>⋯</b> next to its name → <b>Workflows</b><br>2. Choose <b>«Post to a channel when a webhook request is received»</b> → Next → choose team and channel → <b>Add workflow</b><br>3. Copy the address shown and paste it here',
    'cg.notion.t': 'Connect Notion', 'cg.notion.p': '1. Open <b>notion.so/profile/integrations</b> → <b>New integration</b> → name «Verba Manent IA», type «Internal» → Save → copy the <b>Secret</b> (starts with ntn_ or secret_)<br>2. Open the Notion page where you want the minutes → <b>⋯</b> top right → <b>Connections</b> → add «Verba Manent IA»<br>3. On the same page <b>Share → Copy link</b> and paste it below',
    'cg.notion.k': 'Secret (ntn_… or secret_…)', 'cg.notion.l': 'Link of the Notion page',
    'cg.crm.t': 'Connect the CRM', 'cg.crm.hs': 'HubSpot', 'cg.crm.wh': 'Other CRMs (Zapier, Make…)',
    'cg.hs.p': '1. In HubSpot: ⚙ <b>Settings</b> → <b>Integrations</b> → <b>Private Apps</b> → <b>Create a private app</b>, name «Verba Manent IA»<br>2. In <b>Scopes</b> tick <b>crm.objects.contacts.read</b> and <b>crm.objects.contacts.write</b> → Create<br>3. Copy the <b>access token</b> (starts with pat-) and paste it here<br>The minutes go as a note in the participants\' records (found by email).',
    'cg.wh.p': '1. In <b>Zapier</b> (or Make, n8n) create a flow starting from <b>«Webhooks – Catch Hook»</b><br>2. Copy the webhook address and paste it here<br>3. In the flow choose where to send the minutes (Salesforce, Pipedrive, Zoho…): title, date, participants with email, summary, to-dos and text arrive.',
