    'av.fatto': '✓ Done, they know', 'av.ok': 'Participants informed', 'av.ok.alle': 'at {o}', 'av.rivedi': 'see the message again',
    'av.m.riu': "Hello everyone. Just to let you know, I'm recording and transcribing this meeting with Verba Manent IA to prepare the minutes. The recording stays on my computer and won't be shared. If anyone has an objection, please let me know.",
    'av.m.lez': "Hello Professor, I'm recording and transcribing this lecture with Verba Manent IA for my personal study only. The recording stays on my computer and won't be shared. If you'd rather I didn't, please tell me and I'll stop right away.",
    'av.m.aula': "Just to let you know, I'm recording and transcribing this lecture for my personal study only: the recording stays on my computer and won't be shared. If anyone has an objection, please tell me.",
    'av.m.web': "Hello, I'm recording and transcribing this webinar with Verba Manent IA for personal use only. The recording stays on my computer and won't be shared. If that's not allowed, please tell me and I'll stop.",
    'nav.fare': 'To-dos', 'cf.h': 'To-dos', 'cf.sub0': 'The commitments made in work meetings: who does what, by when.', 'cf.sub': 'The commitments made in work meetings · {a} open', 'cf.sub2': 'The commitments made in work meetings · {a} open, {s} overdue', 'cf.v.t': 'The to-dos from your meetings show up here', 'cf.v.s': 'When you record a work meeting, Claude writes the minutes and picks out the commitments. You find them all here, together.', 'cf.v1.t': 'You record a meeting', 'cf.v1': 'In Record choose «Work meeting».', 'cf.v2.t': 'Claude writes the minutes', 'cf.v2': 'With who does what and by when.', 'cf.v3.t': 'You tick it when done', 'cf.v3': 'At the next meeting, what is already done gets ticked by itself.', 'cf.v.b': '💼 Record a meeting', 'cf.v.studio': 'Using it to study? For lectures you do not need this page: everything is in «My recordings».', 'cf.aperte': 'Open', 'cf.fatte': 'Done', 'cf.tutte': 'All', 'cf.tutti': 'Everyone', 'cf.cosa': 'WHAT', 'cf.chi': 'WHO', 'cf.entro': 'DUE', 'cf.da': 'FROM', 'cf.vuoto': 'No to-dos. They come from the meeting minutes.', 'cf.vuoto2': 'Nothing here.', 'cf.auto': 'ticked by the minutes of {d}', 'cf.ultima': '📋 Since last time ({n})', 'cf.ultima.s': 'Still open: {l}. I pass them to Claude: if today they say they are done, they get ticked and the minutes say so.',
    'md.h': 'What kind of meeting?', 'md.modifica': 'Edit', 'md.mio': '✎ My template', 'md.generica.s': 'The normal minutes: summary, decisions, to-dos, open points, next meeting.', 'md.vendita.s': 'Plus: what the customer wants, objections, price and terms said, next step, chance of closing.', 'md.colloquio.s': 'Plus: experience, strengths, doubts, candidate\'s questions, terms said.', 'md.uno_a_uno.s': 'Plus: what goes well, difficulties, goals, what is needed from the manager.', 'md.classe.s': 'Plus: class progress, reported situations, decisions, messages to families.', 'md.condominio.s': 'Plus: attendees and proxies, agenda, resolutions with votes, approved expenses.', 'md.consulenza.s': 'Plus: client situation, requests, advice given, documents to bring, next appointment.', 'md.mio.s': 'Plus: {d}', 'md.mio.t': 'My meeting template', 'md.mio.d': 'Write which parts you want in the minutes, for example: «Site status, safety issues, materials to order, who does what».', 'md.mio.nome': 'Name (e.g. Site meeting)', 'md.ricordo': 'I remember the template for meetings with this name.',
