    'lm.prova.t': 'The action potential', 'lm.prova1': 'When the stimulus passes the threshold, about minus fifty-five millivolts, the sodium channels open and the cell depolarises.', 'lm.prova2': 'Right after, the potassium channels open: this is repolarisation. In the refractory period the cell does not respond to a new stimulus.', 'lm.off': 'These choices apply with DSA mode on.',
